{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：13:12 2026-11-11 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"市建局土瓜灣道項目今截標 最少收3份標書\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/afcf7e53ad0f80e4f4e9e8c7bfbfb229/2026-11/KF_Yan_-_2026-11-11T130953_557.png\"/>\n<p>市建局土瓜灣道/榮光街項目今截標，就現場所見最少錄3份標書，入標財團包括長實及中國海外，信和就與鷹君合組財團參與競投。</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/336ac6efb6b26ddeb117f582dcf7b28a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_12_05_58_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bbf4e2b82966d2699c764f4c2b9bbec8/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_12_06_06_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/65c06e4da1d523ca5251fc92ac27089e/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_12_06_09_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f1f4433c7065e8874fe3f66728ab1286/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_12_06_10_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4438bcbfb22bb23a7c994ef614fed8cb/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_12_06_11_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<p>上述項目涵蓋土瓜灣道、馬頭圍道、鴻福街、啟明街、玉成街等五條街道組成的地盤，面積約5.89萬方呎，因採「組裝合成」建築法（MiC），早前已獲城規會批准放寬高限發展，以興建1050伙。</p>\n<p>消息指出，項目以價高者得作勝負關鍵；而且設有分紅要求，日後賣樓收益逾91億元，便須與市建局分紅，首8億元分紅比例為20%，其後分紅比例則為30%。至於，商場部分，發展商及市建局各擁有一半業權，並持有至少5年。</p>\n<p>相關文章：市建局土瓜灣道項目明截標 市場估值約39億至48億</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T05:33:16.085908+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":313,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T05:12:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T05:26:30.793675+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T05:26:30.793675+00:00","content_hash":"3ed5b80d5f48be2f61ea98574b19da66b12b9f92c6cbc80915260faf39dce029","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}